<title>UK: Rabobank sets 300 million mark bond.</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets 300 million mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Rabobank and Goldman Sachs Frankfurt.  BORROWER   RABOBANK NEDERLAND BA</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.50	MATURITY    28.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.10    PAY DATE   S07.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    99.85     SPREAD	+8 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT/AMST  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-10    SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  N/LANDS   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.75	LIST FEE    0.50</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
